# （vendor/gateway-hub/ 本身要入库，否则构建无法复现。）
src-tauri/resources/gateway-hub/
src-tauri/resources/gateway-manifest.json
public/companion/
public/companion-demo/
src-tauri/binaries/agent-studio-runtime-*
*.local

